Package: nas-admin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, samba, libjpeg-dev | libjpeg62-turbo, libheif1 | libheif-dev
Recommends: caddy | nginx
Maintainer: Tender Software India <dev1@tendersoftware.in>
Description: NAS Admin panel with Samba backup shares
 FastAPI admin panel and user portal for a Samba-based backup NAS:
 storage dashboard, device folders, user invites, file browser,
 gallery, retention and logs. Installs as a systemd service.
